+every switch off unless set, each switch's parsing and refusals, and the call routing each one changes, with
+recording fakes for the CUDA extensions. The kernels' bits are checked on a GPU (tests/cuda/test_glm_decode_kernels.py); the decode-window selection's tokens are checked here through the Triton interpreter."""
